            "review_text": "Son H\n1 contribution\n0\nthe place music and entertainment in gaia Melia vinpearl\nJul 2023 • Friends\nThe space here is airy and clean. In the evening, we can see 3 famous bridges in Da Nang and see the shimmering banks of the Han River.\nWe cannot miss the typical dishes and drinks here. In particular, there is a fresh grilled seafood combo with 2 very typical sauces. We can order more cocktails and sit and enjoy the beautiful space in the evening.\nThe staff in here is very friendlly and enthusiasm. They have alway beautifull smile.\nI really enjoy it here\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 16, 2023\nMelia Vinpearl\nXin chào Our valued guest,\n\nThank you for choosing to stay at Melia Vinpearl DaNang Riverfront. We are incredibly grateful that you took the time out to leave us this wonderful review. \nWe are happy to know that you were impressed by our facilities, food and beverage services and especially our customer services. It is always our pleasure to hear that our guests were left highly satisfied with their overall experiences. Thank you again for highlighting our services and facilities. We look forward to welcome you for another great stay.\n\nSincerely,\n\nLe Dalena\nGuest Experience Supervisor\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
