            "review_text": "Trương Vĩnh Long\nDa Nang, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nBest bar in town with amazing Han River view\nAug 2023 • Couples\nI came here with my friend to enjoy the the swimming pool with Han river view with 3 famost bridges at Da nang.\nAmazing local drink which you can fins anywhere in street but this bar made it diffrence . This 3 flavor sugarcane juice\nWritten August 2, 2023\nMelia Vinpearl\nXin chào Our valued guest ,\n\nThank you for choosing to stay at Melia Vinpearl DaNang Riverfront. We are incredibly grateful that you took the time out to leave us this great review. \nOur hotel values put guest satisfaction as top priority and we are committed to our guests. Your feedback is precious point for head of management know how to improve and make exceptional services for customers.\nOnce again, thank you for choosing us and we look forward to welcome you back for another great stay.\n\nSincerely,\n\nThe Hotel Management\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
